{"id":"cue-0-0","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-0-0","source_start_seconds":0,"source_end_seconds":3.82,"speaking_duration_seconds":3.82,"text":"来 看一下这个卖月饼的 它是怎么骗人的"}
{"id":"cue-1-3820","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-0-0","source_start_seconds":3.82,"source_end_seconds":5.48,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.66,"text":"这是我在斗鱼上买的五人月饼"}
{"id":"cue-2-6060","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-0-0","source_start_seconds":6.06,"source_end_seconds":7.54,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.48,"text":"这个真的很好吃"}
{"id":"cue-3-9430","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-3-9430","source_start_seconds":9.43,"source_end_seconds":12.51,"speaking_duration_seconds":3.08,"text":"这个价格倒是有两斤 十个金牌的五人月饼"}
{"id":"cue-4-13330","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-4-13330","source_start_seconds":13.33,"source_end_seconds":15.91,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.58,"text":"哇 里面的满满都是料 花生米 杏仁"}
{"id":"cue-5-15910","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-4-13330","source_start_seconds":15.91,"source_end_seconds":17.11,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.2,"text":"这个料看上去好煮"}
{"id":"cue-6-20030","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-6-20030","source_start_seconds":20.03,"source_end_seconds":20.59,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.56,"text":"好爽"}
{"id":"cue-7-20590","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-6-20030","source_start_seconds":20.59,"source_end_seconds":22.59,"speaking_duration_seconds":2,"text":"冬换那五人月饼咱也卖回来了"}
{"id":"cue-8-22590","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-6-20030","source_start_seconds":22.59,"source_end_seconds":24.53,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.94,"text":"说实话 它这个确实便宜"}
{"id":"cue-9-24530","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-6-20030","source_start_seconds":24.53,"source_end_seconds":27.03,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.5,"text":"在外面这一块怎么也得三五块钱"}
{"id":"cue-10-27030","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-10-27030","source_start_seconds":27.03,"source_end_seconds":29.51,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.48,"text":"它做的这么便宜 必然是有什么冒劲"}
{"id":"cue-11-29510","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-10-27030","source_start_seconds":29.51,"source_end_seconds":30.91,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.4,"text":"如果真有问题的话"}
{"id":"cue-12-30910","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-10-27030","source_start_seconds":30.91,"source_end_seconds":32.51,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.6,"text":"咱们就直接给它曝光水"}
{"id":"cue-13-32510","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-10-27030","source_start_seconds":32.51,"source_end_seconds":34.63,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.12,"text":"如果是真的划算 而且好吃的话"}
{"id":"cue-14-34630","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-10-27030","source_start_seconds":34.63,"source_end_seconds":36.01,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.38,"text":"咱们就当给它推荐了"}
{"id":"cue-15-36010","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-10-27030","source_start_seconds":36.01,"source_end_seconds":37.11,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.1,"text":"来 打开看看"}
{"id":"cue-16-38030","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-16-38030","source_start_seconds":38.03,"source_end_seconds":40.63,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.6,"text":"来你看看 它这个月饼还真挺大的"}
{"id":"cue-17-40630","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-16-38030","source_start_seconds":40.63,"source_end_seconds":43.15,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.52,"text":"也挺厚的 并不是它这个块多了"}
{"id":"cue-18-43150","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-16-38030","source_start_seconds":43.15,"source_end_seconds":44.71,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.56,"text":"就给咱做的小了薄了"}
{"id":"cue-19-44710","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-16-38030","source_start_seconds":44.71,"source_end_seconds":47.23,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.52,"text":"是一个正常的月饼 还挺有分量"}
{"id":"cue-20-47230","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-20-47230","source_start_seconds":47.23,"source_end_seconds":50.13,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.9,"text":"它说每一块是有100克的"}
{"id":"cue-21-50130","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-20-47230","source_start_seconds":50.13,"source_end_seconds":52.53,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.4,"text":"那话不多说 咱称一下有没有圈金少两"}
{"id":"cue-22-52530","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-20-47230","source_start_seconds":52.53,"source_end_seconds":54.75,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.22,"text":"看 已经清零了 咱们随便拿一块"}
{"id":"cue-23-55230","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-20-47230","source_start_seconds":55.23,"source_end_seconds":57.67,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.44,"text":"嘿 真是100克啊 这么准吗"}
{"id":"cue-24-58910","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-24-58910","source_start_seconds":58.91,"source_end_seconds":60.77,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.86,"text":"也是100克 咱再随机拿一个"}
{"id":"cue-25-62470","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-25-62470","source_start_seconds":62.47,"source_end_seconds":63.15,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.68,"text":"可以啊"}
{"id":"cue-26-63150","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-25-62470","source_start_seconds":63.15,"source_end_seconds":65.93,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.78,"text":"那重量确实是没问题 是没有确金少量"}
{"id":"cue-27-65930","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-25-62470","source_start_seconds":65.93,"source_end_seconds":67.95,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.02,"text":"再来看一下品名五人月饼"}
{"id":"cue-28-67950","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-25-62470","source_start_seconds":67.95,"source_end_seconds":70.75,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.8,"text":"配料里边确实是有这个青红丝跟瓜丁的"}
{"id":"cue-29-70750","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-29-70750","source_start_seconds":70.75,"source_end_seconds":72.61,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.86,"text":"咱们看看五人少不少"}
{"id":"cue-30-73130","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-29-70750","source_start_seconds":73.13,"source_end_seconds":76.29,"speaking_duration_seconds":3.16,"text":"花嘴银 花生银 核桃银 芝麻银 性银"}
{"id":"cue-31-76290","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-29-70750","source_start_seconds":76.29,"source_end_seconds":77.39,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.1,"text":"是对劲的"}
{"id":"cue-32-77390","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-29-70750","source_start_seconds":77.39,"source_end_seconds":79.19,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.8,"text":"然后知名标准产家信息是有的"}
{"id":"cue-33-79190","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-29-70750","source_start_seconds":79.19,"source_end_seconds":80.45,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.26,"text":"保值期是四个月"}
{"id":"cue-34-80450","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-34-80450","source_start_seconds":80.45,"source_end_seconds":83.25,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.8,"text":"看一下它这个日期是26年8月28日"}
{"id":"cue-35-83250","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-34-80450","source_start_seconds":83.25,"source_end_seconds":85.73,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.48,"text":"3点45分的 确实也不是那种老日期"}
{"id":"cue-36-85730","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-34-80450","source_start_seconds":85.73,"source_end_seconds":87.61,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.88,"text":"临期产品 从这个配料来看"}
{"id":"cue-37-87610","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-34-80450","source_start_seconds":87.61,"source_end_seconds":89.91,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.3,"text":"确实是一个老五人月饼 没问题"}
{"id":"cue-38-89910","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-34-80450","source_start_seconds":89.91,"source_end_seconds":92.71,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.8,"text":"那咱们也得尝尝它的味道到底是怎么样"}
{"id":"cue-39-92710","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-34-80450","source_start_seconds":92.71,"source_end_seconds":94.67,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.96,"text":"就这个 咱给它打开"}
{"id":"cue-40-95710","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-40-95710","source_start_seconds":95.71,"source_end_seconds":98.85,"speaking_duration_seconds":3.14,"text":"打开之后 它是这样的 上面写着金牌五人"}
{"id":"cue-41-98850","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-40-95710","source_start_seconds":98.85,"source_end_seconds":100.07,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.22,"text":"来 咱掰开看看"}
{"id":"cue-42-100670","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-42-100670","source_start_seconds":100.67,"source_end_seconds":103.55,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.88,"text":"它这个掰着还是很软的 感觉"}
{"id":"cue-43-104350","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-43-104350","source_start_seconds":104.35,"source_end_seconds":107.57,"speaking_duration_seconds":3.22,"text":"哎呦 看看 这个馅料还真是挺足的"}
{"id":"cue-44-107570","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-43-104350","source_start_seconds":107.57,"source_end_seconds":110.85,"speaking_duration_seconds":3.28,"text":"而且看看 它这个皮确实是挺薄的"}
{"id":"cue-45-110850","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-43-104350","source_start_seconds":110.85,"source_end_seconds":113.09,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.24,"text":"算是这种皮薄馅大型的了"}
{"id":"cue-46-113090","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-43-104350","source_start_seconds":113.09,"source_end_seconds":114.17,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.08,"text":"来 看看"}
{"id":"cue-47-115350","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-47-115350","source_start_seconds":115.35,"source_end_seconds":116.89,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.54,"text":"这个料确实挺足"}
{"id":"cue-48-116890","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-47-115350","source_start_seconds":116.89,"source_end_seconds":118.83,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.94,"text":"跟咱以前吃的那个五人月饼"}
{"id":"cue-49-118830","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-47-115350","source_start_seconds":118.83,"source_end_seconds":119.99,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.16,"text":"确实是差不多的"}
{"id":"cue-50-119990","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-47-115350","source_start_seconds":119.99,"source_end_seconds":121.29,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.3,"text":"咱们再随机拿一个"}
{"id":"cue-51-121290","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-47-115350","source_start_seconds":121.29,"source_end_seconds":122.69,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.4,"text":"来 再给它打开看看"}
{"id":"cue-52-125780","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-52-125780","source_start_seconds":125.78,"source_end_seconds":127,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.22,"text":"它这个确实挺软"}
{"id":"cue-53-128000","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-53-128000","source_start_seconds":128,"source_end_seconds":130.9,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.9,"text":"看看 确实都属于这种皮薄馅大型的"}
{"id":"cue-54-132060","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-54-132060","source_start_seconds":132.06,"source_end_seconds":133.88,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.82,"text":"这馅确实挺饱满"}
{"id":"cue-55-133880","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-54-132060","source_start_seconds":133.88,"source_end_seconds":135.48,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.6,"text":"来 那咱们尝一尝"}
{"id":"cue-56-139740","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-56-139740","source_start_seconds":139.74,"source_end_seconds":142.76,"speaking_duration_seconds":3.02,"text":"吃着 确实是咱们想吃的那种五人月饼"}
{"id":"cue-57-142760","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-56-139740","source_start_seconds":142.76,"source_end_seconds":145.9,"speaking_duration_seconds":3.14,"text":"而且呢 它做这个确实是馅很大 皮是薄"}
{"id":"cue-58-145900","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-56-139740","source_start_seconds":145.9,"source_end_seconds":147.8,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.9,"text":"而且吃起来是特别软的"}
{"id":"cue-59-147800","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-56-139740","source_start_seconds":147.8,"source_end_seconds":149.34,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.54,"text":"你看 它这个特别软"}
{"id":"cue-60-149340","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-56-139740","source_start_seconds":149.34,"source_end_seconds":151.1,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.76,"text":"不像以往那种帮硬帮硬的"}
{"id":"cue-61-151100","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-56-139740","source_start_seconds":151.1,"source_end_seconds":154.5,"speaking_duration_seconds":3.4,"text":"它这个吃起来 三分甜 七分香"}
{"id":"cue-62-154500","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-62-154500","source_start_seconds":154.5,"source_end_seconds":156.32,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.82,"text":"确实很软 很好吃"}
{"id":"cue-63-156320","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-62-154500","source_start_seconds":156.32,"source_end_seconds":160,"speaking_duration_seconds":3.68,"text":"真没想到 它这个价格用料居然能做得这么扎实"}
{"id":"cue-64-160000","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-62-154500","source_start_seconds":160,"source_end_seconds":162.18,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.18,"text":"不错 搅的确实挺香的"}
{"id":"cue-65-162180","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-62-154500","source_start_seconds":162.18,"source_end_seconds":164.4,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.22,"text":"确实像咱们70后 80后 90后"}
{"id":"cue-66-164400","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-62-154500","source_start_seconds":164.4,"source_end_seconds":166.1,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.7,"text":"小时候吃那个五人月饼"}
{"id":"cue-67-166100","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-62-154500","source_start_seconds":166.1,"source_end_seconds":167.3,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.2,"text":"真挺不错"}
{"id":"cue-68-167300","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-68-167300","source_start_seconds":167.3,"source_end_seconds":169.36,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.06,"text":"那个月饼咱们就错了"}
{"id":"cue-69-169360","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-68-167300","source_start_seconds":169.36,"source_end_seconds":171.8,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.44,"text":"它做的确实是既便宜又好吃"}
{"id":"cue-70-171800","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-68-167300","source_start_seconds":171.8,"source_end_seconds":174.96,"speaking_duration_seconds":3.16,"text":"确实像咱们要找的那种小时候吃那种五人月饼"}
{"id":"cue-71-174960","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-68-167300","source_start_seconds":174.96,"source_end_seconds":177.32,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.36,"text":"但是我觉得它做了一定的升级"}
{"id":"cue-72-177880","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-68-167300","source_start_seconds":177.88,"source_end_seconds":179.62,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.74,"text":"咱们小时候吃那个稍微要硬"}
{"id":"cue-73-179620","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-68-167300","source_start_seconds":179.62,"source_end_seconds":181.86,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.24,"text":"它这个确实特别软弱"}
{"id":"cue-74-181860","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-74-181860","source_start_seconds":181.86,"source_end_seconds":184,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.14,"text":"而且馅料特别足"}
{"id":"cue-75-184000","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-74-181860","source_start_seconds":184,"source_end_seconds":186.18,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.18,"text":"这个价值能做到这个品质"}
{"id":"cue-76-186180","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-74-181860","source_start_seconds":186.18,"source_end_seconds":187.54,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.36,"text":"我觉得还是相当不错的"}
{"id":"cue-77-187540","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-74-181860","source_start_seconds":187.54,"source_end_seconds":188.9,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.36,"text":"现在也算是很高了"}
{"id":"cue-78-188900","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-74-181860","source_start_seconds":188.9,"source_end_seconds":190.34,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.44,"text":"有需要的 你放心吞吧"}
{"id":"cue-79-190340","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-74-181860","source_start_seconds":190.34,"source_end_seconds":191.04,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.7,"text":"请看吧"}
